.\n\nDocument these assumptions with Java assertions:\n\n- Require argument extraction only after the input matches its command\n  word. Parser recognition owns this precondition, while invalid user\n  commands still use MonaException handling.\n- Require MainWindow.fxml to supply its controller after loading. The\n  bundled layout and its controller declaration must stay synchronized.\n- Clear the previous GUI response and require every command path to emit\n  a fresh response. Each successful command or handled validation error\n  must produce text for the dialog.\n\nAdd a focused test for the argument-extraction contract. Assertions do\nnot replace any runtime validation or storage error handling.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":19,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"2f9a8b9a6213755e5001be9071487c511c1ad983","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Commands: Centralize task number validation","messageBody":"Mark, unmark, and delete repeat the same task number checks.\n\nThis duplication can drift and produce inconsistent command behavior.\n\nCentralize the checks and one-based conversion in Command.\n\nKeep each empty-list message at its call site.\n\nThis retains command-specific feedback while shared validation has one\nsource.\n\nCover valid commands and both validation paths with regression tests.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":80,"deletions":39}}},{"hash":"7f2f7be369812f096a0da4405cba86be5a310e5b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use streams to filter matching tasks","messageBody":"Task matching uses an explicit loop to filter descriptions and build a\nresult list. This obscures the operation\u0027s filter-and-collect intent.\n\nReplace the loop with a sequential stream that filters matching\ndescriptions and collects them into a new ArrayList.\n\nKeeping an ArrayList preserves the method\u0027s public return type, result\nmutability, and task order while demonstrating streams in a natural\ncollection-processing use case.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":4,"deletions":8}}},{"hash":"3ec9793fd69eb68e42992d70c48b5da0dda5a1af","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #3 from angus-yxz/branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"Use streams to filter matching tasks","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"183388e674266298f3604f801803cb28f5f6bee2","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #4 from angus-yxz/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"Commands: Centralize task number validation","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"9fa1277dabd66315e7c50c9ba7872a6cd28d4bef","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from angus-yxz/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Document internal invariants with assertions","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"angus-yxz":{"java":3057,"md":863,"fxml":51,"sh":0,"bat":0,"gradle":25,"txt":0}},"authorContributionVariance":{"angus-yxz":496830.5},"authorDisplayNameMap":{"angus-yxz":"CS2103T-F08-4 YIM ..NGUS"}}
